# 00_setup.cxc -- look and base representations.
#
# Sourced by render_shrink.cxc after 00_open.cxc and generated.cxc, so every
# model number and named selection below is already defined.
#
# The three settings that do most of the work here are `lighting soft`,
# `lighting shadows true` and `graphics silhouettes true`. Soft lighting is
# ChimeraX's ambient-occlusion mode: it samples visibility per vertex, so
# crevices darken and the molecule reads as a solid object instead of a
# flat-shaded blob. Silhouettes then give it the drawn edge that survives
# compression and small screens.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ canvas
set bgColor black
graphics silhouettes true width 1.6 color black
set subdivision 4

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- lighting
lighting soft
lighting multiShadow 64
lighting shadows true
lighting intensity 1.05
lighting fillIntensity 0.32
lighting ambientIntensity 0.85
lighting depthCue false
material dull
material reflectivity 0.28

# Ambient occlusion is what sells this; when iterating on timing rather than
# looks, drop multiShadow to 16 and the render gets several times faster.

# ---------------------------------------------------------- hide everything
# Shots turn on exactly what they need. Starting from "nothing visible" means
# a mistake shows up as a missing object rather than as a stray one hanging
# around from three shots ago.
hide #1-7 models
hide #1-7 atoms
hide #1-7 cartoons
hide #1-7 surfaces

# ------------------------------------------------------ base look per model
# 1 -- the "before" structure (full-length cIAP1, or BIR3 standing in)
cartoon #1
cartoon style #1 modeh tube rad 1.0 sides 12
color #1 cE3
color motifFull cMotif

# 2 -- crystal receptor
cartoon #2
cartoon style #2 modeh tube rad 1.0 sides 12
color #2 cE3
color motifRef cMotif
color hotspotsRef cHotspot
style ligandRef ball
size ligandRef ballScale 0.55
color ligandRef cLigand
style zincSeed sphere
color #2:ZN cZinc

# 3 -- the de novo binder
cartoon #3
cartoon style #3 modeh tube rad 1.1 sides 12
color binder cBinder

# 4 -- the seed that survives the dissolve
cartoon #4
cartoon style #4 modeh tube rad 1.1 sides 12
color motifSeed cMotif
color hotspotsSeed cHotspot
style ligandSeed ball
size ligandSeed ballScale 0.55
color ligandSeed cLigand
style zincSeed sphere
size zincSeed ballScale 0.9
color zincSeed cZinc

# 5 -- dissolve. Spheres, not cartoon: once the bulk starts flying apart the
# backbone geometry is meaningless and a ribbon drawn through it whips across
# the screen. Small spheres read as fragments and behave at every frame.
style #5 sphere
size #5 ballScale 0.28
color dissolveBulk cE3
color dissolveKeep cMotif
color dissolveHet cLigand
color #5:ZN cZinc

# 6 -- condensation. Beads for the same reason, and because mid-diffusion
# there is no secondary structure for ChimeraX to assign.
style #6 sphere
size #6 ballScale 0.45
color #6 cBinder

# 7 -- the final breathing complex
cartoon #7
cartoon style #7 modeh tube rad 1.1 sides 12
color #7 cBinder
color #7/A cMotif
style #7 & ~protein ball
size #7 & ~protein ballScale 0.6
color #7:ZN cZinc
